--- body ---
## Scope

Add the benchmark-supported configurations as curated registry rows and one
entry-id selector. This exposes candidates; it does not select a winner.

## Exit criteria

- Unset configuration still resolves to the incumbent MiniLM entry.
- Each row is complete and pinned; no raw per-field user overrides exist.
- Unknown or incomplete entries fail explicitly before index access.
- Index coexistence and invalidation use the complete entry fingerprint.
